**Recommendation**: Implement application-level retry tracking or configure a DLQ with `maxReceiveCount` on the SQS queue. At the application level:
```typescript
const MAX_RETRIES = 3;
// Track via message attribute ApproximateReceiveCount
const receiveCount = parseInt(msg.Attributes?.ApproximateReceiveCount ?? "0");
if (receiveCount > MAX_RETRIES) {
  // Delete or move to DLQ programmatically
  await sqs.send(new DeleteMessageCommand({ QueueUrl: QUEUE_URL, ReceiptHandle: msg.ReceiptHandle! }));
  console.error("Message exceeded max retries, discarded:", msg.MessageId);
  return;
}
```
